sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant API as /intelligence/analyze
    participant SUP as Supervisor
    participant MAT as Matcher agent
    participant PRO as Promo agent
    participant STR as Strategy agent
    participant REF as Reflection
    participant HQ as HITL queue

    API->>SUP: execute_reasoning_flow(competitor, candidate, tau)
    Note over SUP: Plan (step budget enforced)
    SUP->>MAT: compare attributes, pack size, specs
    MAT-->>SUP: verdict + confidence
    SUP->>PRO: dissect promotion mechanics
    PRO-->>SUP: effective price, requires_map_review
    SUP->>STR: hypothesis + margin illustration
    STR-->>SUP: suggested action (assumptions named)
    SUP->>REF: self-check for contradictions
    alt contradiction found
        REF-->>SUP: correction applied
    end
    alt contradictory or low confidence
        SUP->>HQ: enqueue task with evidence
        SUP-->>API: ESCALATED_HITL
    else resolved
        SUP-->>API: TIER_3_AGENTIC verdict
    end
    Note over SUP,STR: LLM calls are simulated unless a provider is configured
